  "id": "dynamic-trait",
  "term": "dynamic trait",
  "definition": "A dynamic trait is a characteristic whose expression changes as conditions in the environment change, rather than staying fixed. It is best understood by looking at the pattern of responses across changing situations, not by a single summary measure.",
